lumo-greeter (1.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Port the theme to sddm 0.21 (Qt6): the greeter exposes sddm,
    sessionModel, userModel, config as context properties - no importable
    Sddm module exists, so the old API failed the whole QML load.

  * Drop the Sddm.Components import (unused; Debian trixie ships it as
    SddmComponents for Qt6 - the broken import made SDDM fall back to its
    builtin grey theme instead of the Lumo greeter).

  * Initial Lumo OS 1.0 "Aurora" release.

 -- Lumo OS Team <salom600@users.noreply.github.com>  Sun, 30 Aug 2026 08:00:00 +0000
